  "longBusinessSummary": "plenum AG, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the provision of management consulting services to energy and mobility, financial institutions, and insurance companies in Germany, Austria, and Switzerland. The company offers management and transformation consulting services, which include digitalization strategy, IT strategy, data and architecture advisory, IT management and compliance, cyber resilience, and the transition of business models towards sustainability. It also provides ERP solutions including strategic test management and salesforce CRM; strategic IT management; cloud strategy; artificial intelligence; data and information management; IT risk and security; and non-financial risk management. The company is based in Frankfurt am Main, Germany with additional offices in Vienna, Austria; and Zurich, Switzerland.",
